<title>QATAR: TENNIS-QATAR OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QATAR OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the $635,000</p>
<p>Qatar Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat 6-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) 6-1</p>
<p>2-6 6-3</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Magnus Larsson (Sweden) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>8-Jim Courier (U.S.) beat 1-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat 5-Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
</text>
